      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "For those without Discord (thanks to @{5ce09c4ff1ef661188867ab5|full_name} on X: https://x.com/slord399/status/2041566412758515796):\n\n- In Steam, right-click VRChat, select \"Properties\", then \"Game Versions & Betas\".\n\n- At the bottom, enter the code `LetsGoFastAgain`.\n\n- Opt-in to the `perf-test` beta branch.\n\nThen, play VRChat as usual.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
